{489}{I shall return, sir.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{490}{What are you here for, then? I told you to hurry it up. The bounty hunter is in town already. You're making me look bad.}{What are you here for, then? I told you to hurry it up. The bounty hunter is in town already. You're making me look bad.}{}{}{}{ }
{491}{I'm on my way, then.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
