{500}{You have quite the way of completely bungling a job, don't you? Because they had to call in outside help to kill the murderer my job is hanging by a thread! Thanks for nothing, fool.}{You have quite the way of completely bungling a job, don't you? Because they had to call in outside help to kill the murderer my job is hanging by a thread! Thanks for nothing, fool.}{}{}{}{ }
